<title>POLAND: PBR leads Gdynia shipyard consortium.</title>
<headline>PBR leads Gdynia shipyard consortium.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Development Bank SA (PBR) organised a consortium providing the Gdynia shipyard $20.4 million in credit to finance the construction of a ship, the bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said PBR's share amounted to $3.35 million.</p>
<p>The Gdynia shipyard made a 60-million-zloty net loss in the first 10 months of 1996, but expects to turn a profit this year. It is also seeking a strategic investor.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
